 <LayoutItem background="false" blendMode="0" excludeFromExports="0" frame="false" frameJoinStyle="miter" groupUuid="" halign="1" htmlState="1" id="" itemRotation="0" labelText="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial; font-size:3pt; color:#555555; line-height:115%;&quot;>&#xa;&lt;b>Sources&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;Annerstedt van den Bosch, M. et al. (2016): Development of an urban green space indicator and the public health rationale. Scandinavian Journal of Public Health 44(2), 159&amp;ndash;167. https://doi.org/10.1177/1403494815615444&lt;br>&#xa;Crabtree, M., Lodge, C. &amp;amp; Emmerson, P. (2014): A review of pedestrian walking speeds and time needed to cross the road. TRL PPR700.&lt;br>&#xa;EEA (2025a): Exposure of Europe&amp;rsquo;s population to environmental noise. European Environment Agency, 3 October 2025. https://www.eea.europa.eu/ims/exposure-of-europe-population-to-noise&lt;br>&#xa;EEA (2025b): Benchmark analysis against the standards in the revised directive (EU) 2024/2881. Air quality status report 2025. European Environment Agency.&lt;br>&#xa;Grunewald, K., Syrbe, R.-U., Eichler, L. &amp;amp; Kr&amp;uuml;ger, T. (2025): Aktualisierung bundesweiter Indikatoren zur Durchgr&amp;uuml;nung in St&amp;auml;dten. BfN-Schriften 748. Bonn: Bundesamt f&amp;uuml;r Naturschutz.&lt;br>&#xa;Karner, A. A., Eisinger, D. S. &amp;amp; Niemeier, D. A. (2010): Near-roadway air quality: synthesizing the findings from real-world data. Environmental Science &amp;amp; Technology 44(14), 5334&amp;ndash;5344. https://doi.org/10.1021/es100008x&lt;br>&#xa;LANUK (2025): Luftqualit&amp;auml;t NRW, kontinuierliche Messungen, Jahresmittelwerte 2025 (vorl&amp;auml;ufig). https://www.lanuk.nrw.de&lt;br>&#xa;LANUK (2026): Klimaanalyse NRW 2026. Methoden- und Ergebnis&amp;uuml;berblick. LANUK-Fachbericht 171. Recklinghausen.&lt;br>&#xa;Stadt Dortmund (2024): Die Versorgung mit Trinkwasser in Dortmund ist gut und zukunftssicher. Press release, 5 September 2024. https://www.dortmund.de/newsroom&lt;br>&#xa;WHO Regional Office for Europe (2018): Environmental Noise Guidelines for the European Region. Copenhagen.&lt;br>&#xa;Data: Statistisches Bundesamt (2024): Zensus 2022, population and age in 5 groups, 100 m grid, https://www.zensus2022.de; Stadt Dortmund (2026): ALKIS land use, https://open-data.dortmund.de; Stadt Dortmund, Umweltamt (2022): Umgebungsl&amp;auml;rmkartierung IV, Stra&amp;szlig;en Lden, https://open-data.dortmund.de; LANUK (2026): Klimaanalyse NRW, heat classes; OpenStreetMap contributors (2026), https://www.openstreetmap.org. Basemap: Esri (2026), Light Gray Canvas.&#xa;&lt;/div>" marginX="0" marginY="0" opacity="1" outlineWidthM="0.3,mm" position="211.049,189.332,mm" positionLock="false" positionOnPage="211.049,189.332,mm" referencePoint="0" size="81.5547,20.6676,mm" templateUuid="{070bbbb0-6ad4-4126-97bc-8d65bc75553d}" type="65641" uuid="{070bbbb0-6ad4-4126-97bc-8d65bc75553d}" valign="32" visibility="1" zValue="9">
