 <LayoutItem background="false" blendMode="0" excludeFromExports="0" frame="false" frameJoinStyle="miter" groupUuid="" halign="1" htmlState="1" id="" itemRotation="0" labelText="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;&quot;>&#xa;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;&quot;>Assessment matrix: Human health&lt;/b>&#xa;&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse; font-size:6.5pt; margin-top:3px;&quot;>&#xa;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#bfbfbf;&quot;>&#xa; &lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Topic&lt;/th>&#xa; &lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Indicator&lt;/th>&#xa; &lt;th align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Reference value (source)&lt;/th>&#xa; &lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Result&lt;/th>&#xa; &lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Assessment&lt;/th>&#xa;&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td rowspan=&quot;3&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>Air and water quality&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>NO&amp;#8322; annual mean, traffic station Brackeler Stra&amp;szlig;e&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>EU limit 40 &amp;micro;g/m&amp;sup3; now, 20 &amp;micro;g/m&amp;sup3; from 2030 (EEA 2025b)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>32 &amp;micro;g/m&amp;sup3;&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#fee08b;&quot;>Meets current, not 2030 limit&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents &amp;ge; 55 dB Lden road noise&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>WHO guideline 53 dB (WHO 2018); European cities 30&amp;ndash;60 % (EEA 2025a)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>36 %&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#fee08b;&quot;>Above WHO, typical for European cities&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Drinking water quality&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Trinkwasserverordnung (Stadt Dortmund 2024)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>High, same for all&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#a6d96a;&quot;>Meets&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>Exposure to hazards&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents in strong or extreme heat (day and night classes)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>No official share threshold; Dortmund: 396,000 residents in extreme daytime heat, PET &amp;gt; 41 &amp;deg;C (LANUK 2026)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>15 %&lt;/b> (8,835)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Descriptive (see Climate)&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td rowspan=&quot;5&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>Physical and mental wellbeing / healthy living&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents within 300 m walk of free green &amp;ge; 1 ha&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>WHO indicator: all residents (Annerstedt van den Bosch et al. 2016)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>42 %&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#f46d43;&quot;>Not met for 58 %&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents within 500 m walk of free green &amp;ge; 1 ha&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Dortmund 83.8 %, Germany 83.3 %; target 100 % by 2040 (Grunewald et al. 2025)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>77 %&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#f46d43;&quot;>Below Dortmund average&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents in heat within 300 m walk of free green &amp;ge; 1 ha&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>WHO indicator (as above)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>25 %&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#f46d43;&quot;>Not met for 75 %&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents in heat within 500 m walk of free green &amp;ge; 1 ha&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Dortmund 83.8 % (Grunewald et al. 2025)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>62 %&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#f46d43;&quot;>Well below Dortmund average&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;tr>&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>Residents 65+ in heat within 300 m walk of free green &amp;ge; 1 ha&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>WHO indicator (as above)&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888;&quot;>&lt;b>24 %&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xa; &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #888; background:#f46d43;&quot;>Not met for 76 %&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&#xa;&lt;/table>&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6pt; color:#555555;&quot;>Assessment = comparison with official reference values (WHO, EU, EEA, BfN, LANUK, Stadt Dortmund); no own thresholds, no weighting. City averages hide differences within the city. NO&amp;#8322;: LANUK (2025), provisional.&lt;/span>&#xa;&lt;/div>" marginX="0" marginY="0" opacity="1" outlineWidthM="0.3,mm" position="55.7904,145.573,mm" positionLock="false" positionOnPage="55.7904,145.573,mm" referencePoint="0" size="148.41,152.134,mm" templateUuid="{9f4b3097-c819-407b-b79a-787123aa388f}" type="65641" uuid="{9f4b3097-c819-407b-b79a-787123aa388f}" valign="32" visibility="1" zValue="9">
